      "start_line": 70,
      "text": "  rule frequencyOf(X:Int, vCons(V:Val, VS:ValSeq))\n    => (#if X ==Int projectIntTotal(V) #then 1 #else 0 #fi)\n       +Int frequencyOf(X, VS)\n    requires isIntVal(V)"
    },
